@1 = ~Black Dragon Animate Breath~
@2 = ~Black Dragon Animate Breath
(Conjuration)

Level: 7
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 round/level (14 rounds minimum)
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

The Black Dragon Disciple breathes on the ground and creates a being made of his own acid breath, which fights his enemies until the spell expires.

Animated breath (ooze): 65 hit points, Armor Class 4, THAC0 11, 2 attacks per round dealing 2d8 acid damage each (counts as a +2 weapon). Each round, as long as no enemy is in melee reach, it spits Corrosive Spit at the nearest enemy. It is immune to acid and to mind-affecting effects.~

// Creature name
@3 = ~Animated Breath~
